WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.901 --> 00:00:03.537
Well, we were
behind each other in line

00:00:03.537 --> 00:00:04.771
at the grocery store.

00:00:04.771 --> 00:00:08.942
And it was silly,
but I dropped a can of peas.

00:00:08.942 --> 00:00:10.944
And he bent over to pick them up
for me,

00:00:10.944 --> 00:00:14.181
and that's where it started.

00:00:15.849 --> 00:00:17.451
What can I say?

00:00:17.451 --> 00:00:19.653
It was love at first sight.

00:00:19.653 --> 00:00:21.588
We've been together
ever since.

00:00:23.090 --> 00:00:24.925
Well...

00:00:24.925 --> 00:00:30.163
Yes, she always has had
her own way of doing things.

00:00:36.003 --> 00:00:38.038
Okay.

00:00:38.038 --> 00:00:40.908
- I see what's going on here.
- Honey.

00:00:40.908 --> 00:00:42.910
You don't approve
of our engagement.

00:00:42.910 --> 00:00:44.978
- No, they're not like that.
- I'm sorry, sweetheart.

00:00:44.978 --> 00:00:47.047
Yes, they are like that.

00:00:47.047 --> 00:00:49.182
Look at their faces.

00:00:51.184 --> 00:00:54.354
There's no point
in trying to reason with folks

00:00:54.354 --> 00:00:57.124
who can't appreciate
the differences in others.

00:00:57.124 --> 00:00:59.626
You should be ashamed
of yourselves.

00:00:59.626 --> 00:01:02.863
[somber music]

00:01:02.863 --> 00:01:03.864
Honey, wait.

00:01:03.864 --> 00:01:04.932
[door closes]

00:01:10.304 --> 00:01:13.206
I cannot believe that
you would bring a colored man

00:01:13.206 --> 00:01:14.274
into our house.

00:01:14.274 --> 00:01:17.678
♪ ♪

00:01:17.678 --> 00:01:19.580
[sobs]

00:01:19.580 --> 00:01:22.516
[crying]

00:01:22.516 --> 00:01:23.917
He's gone now.

